<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n30989" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴκοσι</span></b>  (for <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴκοσιν</span>
		v. infr.), 
			Att.
		, 
			Ion.
		, also <i><span class="en">Arc.,
				<u>IG</u>5(2).3.1</span></i>
			(<span class="entity">Tegea</span>), and 
			Aeol.
		, ib.<i><span class="en">
			12(2).6.21
		</span></i>
		(<span class="entity">Lesbos</span>):—indecl.,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>twenty</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				2.510
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				748
			</span></i>, etc.; in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i> more freq. in 
				Ep.
			 form <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐείκοσι</span></b> ,
			before a vowel <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐείκοσιν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				1.309
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				6.217
			</span></i>, al.; 
				Dor.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝίκατι</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Leg.Gort.</u>
				4.13
			</span></i>, etc.; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝείκατι</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>Tab.Heracl.</u>
				2.71
			</span></i>; 
				Lacon.
			
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βείκατι</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>; <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴκατι</span></b> 
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(1).693.10
			</span></i> (Corc.), <i><span class="en">
				Theoc.
				4.10
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				5.86
			</span></i>. (Orig. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝί̄κατι</span> and
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐϝί̄κοσι</span>, whence
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐείκοσι</span> in <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝείκατι</span> and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴκατι</span> are late spellings of (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ϝ</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ί̄κατι;
			εἴκοσι</span> is 
				contr.
			 from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ἐϝί̄κοσι</span>.
			Cf. Lat. <i>vīginti</i>, Skt.
				<i>viṃśatis.</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴκοσιν</span> is the only form used by <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
			</span></i>, whether before vowels or consonants (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴκοσ᾽ ἀπολογίζεται</span> is dub. in <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				465
			</span></i>); also (before consonants) <i><span class="en">
				Herod.
				3.91
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>Piet.</u>
				3
			</span></i>, etc., but not common in Inscrr. or Pap., e.g. (before
			consonants) <i><span class="en">
				<u>Schwyzer</u>
				707
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				<u>B</u>
				2
			</span></i> (Ephesus, <span class="entity">vi B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				2.804.155
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv B.C.)</span>, (before a vowel) <i><span class="en">
				<u>PGrenf.</u>
				2.75.7
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iv A. D.)</span>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴκοσι ἔτη,
				εἴκοσι ἡμερῶν</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				12.94
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				49
			</span></i>.)</div>
